orpetto/\", \"version_id\": \"1028adcc8f58b97a56bdaf38560e2073fcd74b2570c5e4f2df54bb019a67de94\", \"decision\": \"reject\", \"reason\": \"Under the Relevance and Exclusions rules, this is a shotgun competition results report about a junior skeet athlete, with no non-firearm competitor gear, so it is out of scope and unconnected to Mammoth gear decisions. No commercial product claims are present beyond incidental sponsor mention of USA Shooting.\", \"piece_ids\": []}\n{\"item_id\": \"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/longshot-app-update-cuts-lag-and-brings-audio-from-the-target/\", \"version_id\": \"d82907286c096b63fddc26d8dc7318d3bcfadfe03d36b4a8d51f44f248ede21f\", \"decision\": \"reject\", \"reason\": \"The Relevance rules cover spotting and measuring gear, but this is a manufacturer announcement of a target-camera app update (Longshot Cameras, company president quoted) with no independent testing, no field experience, and no evidence beyond the company's own description of speed and features. Under Credibility and Commercial incentives, these are unverified manufacturer claims that cannot support a piece, and the item is a press-release-style post rather than substantive evaluation, so it is rejected as promotional content.\", \"piece_ids\": []}\n{\"item_id\": \"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/vincent-hancock-tops-usa-shooting-men-s-skeet-national-team-ranking/\", \"version_id\": \"1e7a4bb89ff6efef1be3e4696d35ca2f64cdc10077388208eccb780086e65a70\", \"decision\": \"reject\", \"reason\": \"This is a shotgun team selection article about skeet and trap athletes and their national team rankings, which falls under the policy's firearm exclusions and has no non-firearm gear content. It also carries a Federal Ammunition sponsorship connection, which is noted but does not change the out-of-scope result.\", \"piece_ids\": []}\n{\"item_id\": \"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/for-its-500th-beretta-makes-the-92fs-a-work-of-art/\", \"version_id\": \"12d5f48dd9c7eb5320c212f6ed6f3cd3e563b38319f510946ac92f9864885e6a\", \"decision\": \"reject\", \"reason\": \"The Exclusions rule bars reviews of firearms, and this is a promotional feature on a Beretta 92FS luxury handgun with no non-firearm competitor gear content. The Relevance rules do not cover handguns, so the item is out of scope.\", \"piece_ids\": []}\n{\"item_id\": \"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/new-sk-guns-charro-negro/\", \"version_id\": \"82edd4f97e8eac9171180270f02be93c76d15bbfd8217f996b4a71ec7ec3c379\", \"decision\": \"reject\", \"reason\": \"Under the Exclusions rule, this is a firearm (a custom Colt 1911 .38 Super) announcement with pre-order details and no independent testing or non-firearm gear relevant to Mammoth conditions. It is also a product promotional post with no substantive content for competitors deciding what to carry.\", \"piece_ids\": []}\n{\"item_id\": \"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/accuracy-x-m45a2-battle-pistols-are-tribute-to-marines-m45a1/\", \"version_id\": \"4b897093aaadb4dfb7c8c1a82a58afb57aed315016d260af576ab3b9828277da\", \"decision\": \"reject\", \"reason\": \"The Exclusions rule bars reviews of firearms, and this is a launch announcement for a limited 1911 pistol set with MSRP and ordering details, which the Relevance rules treat as sales-oriented content. It contains no non-firearm gear relevant to Mammoth.\", \"piece_ids\": []}\n{\"item_id\": \"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/range-usa-s-newest-store-opens-this-weekend-in-smyrna-tenn/\", \"version_id\": \"c1bb1db1a097796f625b9e6259e22b3188c80e9cbcd58fcf3ead816d09f263e3\", \"decision\": \"reject\", \"reason\": \"Under the Relevance rules, this is a grand-opening announcement for an indoor 25-yard range store, which the policy excludes as indoor or casual range content and as promotional material with giveaways. It offers no gear evidence that helps a competitor decide what to carry.\", \"piece_ids\": []}\n{\"item_id\": \"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/vortex-pro-cantilever-mounts-turn-one-base-into-a-system/\", \"version_id\": \"78be8da594dbd9f58f4bbebcba492ab4a5a9d43e14d0124504f62a479e7366bf\", \"decision\": \"defer\", \"reason\": \"This is a Vortex product launch that is relevant under the Relevance rules, since it covers riflescope mounts, red dots, and rangefinder attachments. However, under Credibility and Uncertainty, every specification and capability claim (such as eye relief, modularity, and 'no improvised hardware') is the manufacturer's own, with no independent testing, and Commercial incentives flag the Vortex sponsor connection, so the evidence is too thin to rely on yet.\", \"piece_ids\": []}\n{\"item_id\": \"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/inside-the-tandemkross-adx-race-rifle/\", \"version_id\": \"aa32bbded2eb57cf653850ce9c743b916f96c8156e9397ab45c10c48e96493a8\", \"decision\": \"reject\", \"reason\": \"The Exclusions rule bars reviews of firearms, and this is a rimfire race rifle feature with a $1,899.99 price and an NFA-related note about the SBR and pistol variants. Its content is firearm design and manufacturer description, so it is excluded and out of scope for non-firearm competitor gear.\", \"piece_ids\": []}\n{\"item_id\": \"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/garmin-brings-the-long-range-experts-at-applied-ballistics-in-house/\", \"version_id\": \"70528f262a4dec90d4ae1dbc9e5ab7f6c9a99a4e8f899b6c32c6329a55d0926c\", \"decision\": \"defer\", \"reason\": \"This is a corporate acquisition announcement covering Garmin's purchase of Applied Ballistics, a ballistic solver and data company, which is relevant to the Relevance rules' ballistic apps and calculators category. However, the article offers only a company statement and background history with no independent testing, field results, or product performance evidence, so under Credibility and Freshness it is too thin to rely on and is deferred until product-level evidence appears.\"}","ttft_ms":14615,"type":"result","duration_ms":14661,"uuid":"d8f12f04-fc11-41fc-911